        "nobel_worthiness": "Biomolecular condensates supplied a powerful physical mechanism for intracellular organization, bringing phase separation and nonequilibrium soft matter into cell biology.",
        "attribution": "Hyman and Brangwynne provided decisive biological observations, while Jülicher gave influential physical theory of active condensates.",
        "maturity": "The phenomenon is robust and broadly useful, with a substantial conceptual bridge between physics and biology.",
